@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a game (mode: TwoPlayer | Computer)
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "TwoPlayer" }

### Get game state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/games/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Submit a move (row/column are zero-based)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": "X", "row": 1, "column": 1 }

### Undo last move
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/undo

### Reset game (scoreboard kept)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/reset

### Get scoreboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scoreboard

### Reset scoreboard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scoreboard/reset
